### Teste rápido da API (extensão REST Client do VS Code)
@api = http://localhost:5080

GET {{api}}/api/public/clinic

###
GET {{api}}/api/public/services

###
GET {{api}}/api/public/days?serviceId=1

###
GET {{api}}/api/public/availability?serviceId=1&date=2026-09-24

###
POST {{api}}/api/public/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "serviceId": 1, "date": "2026-09-24", "time": "10:00", "name": "Maria Souza", "phone": "(11) 98765-4321" }

###
# @name login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "jane@janepacheco.com.br", "password": "troque-esta-senha" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}
GET {{api}}/api/admin/appointments?from=2026-09-21&to=2026-09-28
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
